    "short_description": "Operation Ascension is a Sci-Fi Action Roguelike where endless hordes of enemies charge at you, trying to take your ascendant body. You need to slice through the digital chaos and break free. Unleash your powers. Will you be able to complete the transformation and become an Ascended Being?",
